  "custom_ai_disclosure": "<p>Portions of this codebase were implemented with the assistance of LLM-based tools (Claude Code). All architecture, design decisions, and direction were done by a human (Senior Product Security Engineer w/ 10+ years of coding experience), the LLM was used as an implementation aid under continuous human supervision and review.</p>\n",
